# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# One rule per line:  <old path>  <new path>  <status>
# 301 means "moved permanently", which is what search engines and
# browsers should remember.
#
# 2026-08-21: the Employment page became the Volunteer page. Anything
# already linking to /employment (old emails, printed material, search
# results, other people's websites) keeps working instead of hitting a
# "page not found".
/employment  /volunteer  301

