# PYT needs pytnet.org/wizard-of-oz-cast-page/ to keep working after launch.
# "200" is NOT a redirect: Cloudflare serves the /cast/the-wizard-of-oz/
# page AT the old address, and the address bar keeps the old address.
# Both lines are needed (with and without the final slash). New shows use
# their normal /cast/<show>/ address and need nothing here.
# DO NOT rename or delete the CMS cast page "the-wizard-of-oz" while this
# address is in use — these lines point at it.
# ===========================================================================
/wizard-of-oz-cast-page/  /cast/the-wizard-of-oz/  200
/wizard-of-oz-cast-page   /cast/the-wizard-of-oz/  200

