# the right new page instead of the wrong one. Each old address is listed
# with and without the final slash. Order matters: Cloudflare uses the FIRST
# line that matches, so specific lines come before the catch-alls at the end.
# Addresses that are the same on both sites (/, /about/, /subscribe/, /shop/,
# /scholarships/) need nothing. NEVER add a catch-all for /about/* or /* —
# it would also catch real new pages.
# To change where an old address goes, edit the second column only.
# ===========================================================================

